<% content_for :title, "Connect through ZTLP" %>
<div class="panel">
  <div class="panel-h"><h2>Connect through ZTLP</h2></div>
  <div class="panel-b">
    <p class="lede">This panel only answers requests that arrive through a
      verified ZTLP tunnel. Open <code class="mono">admin.trs.ztlp</code> from a
      machine whose ZTLP agent is connected and signed in, and you will land
      here automatically — no form, no password.</p>
    <p class="sub">If you are on a ZTLP machine and this page still appears,
      check that the agent is online (system tray / menu bar) and that your
      account is an administrator of this zone, then reload.</p>
  </div>
</div>
